<script lang="ts">let {data,form}=$props();let input=$derived(form?.input??data.input);</script><svelte:head><title>站点设置 · 站长工作台</title></svelte:head><main><h1>站点设置</h1><p>此操作需要最近 10 分钟内重新认证。<a href="/workspace/security">账号安全</a></p>{#if form?.error}<p role="alert">{form.error}</p>{/if}{#if form?.success}<p role="status">{form.success}</p>{/if}<form method="post"><label>站点名称<input name="siteName" value={input.siteName} maxlength="100" required/></label><label>首页介绍<textarea name="intro" maxlength="1000">{input.intro}</textarea></label><fieldset><legend>Banner 图片与署名</legend><p>填写已上传的媒体键。保存前请在媒体页核对图片；确认公开只授权展示图，原图保持受保护。</p><label>桌面图媒体键<input name="desktop" value={input.banner.desktop??''}/></label><label>手机图媒体键（可选）<input name="mobile" value={input.banner.mobile??''}/></label><label>水平焦点（0–100）<input name="x" type="number" min="0" max="100" value={input.banner.x}/></label><label>垂直焦点（0–100）<input name="y" type="number" min="0" max="100" value={input.banner.y}/></label><label>作者署名<input name="credit" value={input.banner.credit} maxlength="200"/></label><label>来源链接<input name="source" type="url" value={input.banner.source}/></label>{#if input.banner.desktop}<img class="preview" src={`/media/private/${input.banner.desktop}?variant=display`} alt="当前 Banner 预览"/>{/if}<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="grantBanner" value="yes" checked={input.grantBanner}/>确认所选 Banner 展示图可被公众读取</label></fieldset><fieldset><legend>精选阅读（按显示顺序）</legend>{#each [0,1,2] as index}<label>第 {index+1} 项<select name="featured" value={input.featured[index]??''}><option value="">不展示</option>{#each data.content.filter(item=>item.type!=='project') as item}<option value={item.id}>{item.title}</option>{/each}</select></label>{/each}</fieldset><fieldset><legend>首页作品（按显示顺序）</legend>{#each [0,1,2] as index}<label>第 {index+1} 项<select name="project" value={input.projects[index]??''}><option value="">不展示</option>{#each data.content.filter(item=>item.type==='project') as item}<option value={item.id}>{item.title}</option>{/each}</select></label>{/each}</fieldset><fieldset><legend>Giscus 评论</legend><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" value="yes" checked={input.giscus.enabled}/>启用按需评论</label><label>GitHub 仓库（owner/repo）<input name="repo" value={input.giscus.repo??''}/></label><label>仓库 ID<input name="repoId" value={input.giscus.repoId??''}/></label><label>Discussion 分类 ID<input name="categoryId" value={input.giscus.categoryId??''}/></label><p>仅配置既有仓库；本站不会自动创建仓库、OAuth 应用或 Discussion。</p></fieldset><button>保存站点设置</button></form></main><style>.preview{max-width:100%;height:auto}form{max-width:760px}fieldset{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;margin-block:24px;min-width:0}</style>
